{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52949","headline":"石文诗（附存） · 杜甫","name":"石文诗（附存）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗王本在陈芳国，九夜扪之麟篆熟，声振扶桑享天福。\n（见冯贽《云仙杂记》卷一引《文览》）（按：此诗可断定非杜甫作。\n《云仙杂记》一书，传爲唐末人冯贽作，後人虽有疑其爲宋人僞托者，然所举诸证尚不足以定谳。\n今仍从旧说视作唐人之作姑附存杜甫名下。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}